      the northern park lawn.
    spawnPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    initialCameraYaw: 0
  - levelName: 'Course 3: The Horseshoe Loop'
    par: 3
    description: An iconic 180-degree hairpin curve sweeping around the terrace green.
    spawnPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    initialCameraYaw: 0
  - levelName: 'Course 4: The Serpentine Chicane'
    par: 3
